    "sentence_translations": [
      "What Is an Airplane?",
      "",
      "The old man invited Little Wu to stay in his home.",
      "When the people in the Peach Colony found out about this, they all came to talk to him, ..",
      ".. and then invited him to eat at their homes.",
      "Everyone treated him very well.",
      "",
      "Little Wu talked a lot with them. He talked about his friends on the outside and also talked about his work.",
      "",
      "They asked Little Wu a lot of things.",
      "",
      "“What is an airplane? Why can it fly up in the air?”",
      "",
      "“What is a cell phone? Can you talk to people that are very far away?”",
      "",
      "“What is a journalist? What does a journalist do?” …",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "About those people who have hard lives, they all said, “They can come to the Peach Colony. They can live well here.”",
      "",
      "Little Wu said, “Thank you, you are all good people.”",
      "",
      "Little Wu stayed in the Peach Colony for three days before he had to go home.",
      "Although he liked it here very much, he still had a lot of work that needed doing. He had to leave.",
      ""
    ]
